"entity": {
"name": "Lion Finance Group PLC",
"description": "Lion Finance Group Plc engages in the provision of banking, leasing, brokerage, and investment management services. It operates through the following business segments: Retail Banking (RB), Small and Medium Enterprises Banking (SME), Corporate Investment Banking (CIB), and JSC Belarusky Narodny Bank (BNB). The RB segment provides consumer loans, mortgage loans, overdrafts, credit cards and other credit facilities, funds transfers, and settlement services; and handling customers' deposits. The BNB segment is involved in retail and corporate banking services in Belarus. The company was founded on August 15, 2017 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom. (Country of risk by revenue: GE - Bank of Georgia; also owns Ameriabank in Armenia.)",
